WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
Adult hand position and posture.

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.277
Kneel beside the casualty.

00:00:04.277 --> 00:00:19.319
Put one hand heel on the lower half of the sternum and the other on top, interlace and lift the fingers away from the chest wall, lock both elbows, bring the shoulders above the chest and use body weight.
